{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：19:40 2026-11-03 HKT</p>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/942bf332cf54655cf0665c0d81d2eb08/2026-11/KF_-_2026-11-03T192348_116.png\"/>\n<p>在維園網球場舉行的保誠香港網球公開賽次天比賽，名古屋亞運雙打銅牌得主王康怡（Cody）夥拍本站雙打衛冕冠軍球手、國家隊的蔣欣玗有個好開始，她們合力以6:4、7:5擊敗三號種籽、今年溫網女雙八強組合、愛莎尼亞的妮爾及墨西哥的奧莫絲，躋身八強，她們笑言期望越打越遠，在決賽跟美國23項大滿貫錦標的雲露絲威廉絲（Venus Williams）及國家隊徐一璠一較高下。</p>\n<img alt=\"王康怡（右）繼2023年後再次夥拍蔣欣玗（左），今次打出驚喜。徐嘉華攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3d3cb2baf117bfa51e24d34c180dee2a/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-03_at_5_24_52_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"徐嘉華攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/498456f7e5e60e452ba3f13b1d9a06b2/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-03_at_5_25_31_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"徐嘉華攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3cd9a8ecac3e20e37c7edca79b6ce9dc/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-03_at_5_27_05_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"徐嘉華攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/90bbe91532d38475078d215ae28708d2/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-03_at_5_27_37_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"徐嘉華攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c7ca1d0aa47e31539510959f6b3e87f3/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-03_at_5_28_32_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"女雙三號種籽負王康怡/蔣欣玗。徐嘉華攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d3afcef88600319c3c9d46b9a5c768c7/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-03_at_7_33_22_PM_0.jpeg\"/>\n<p>Cody跟蔣欣玗曾於2023年南韓ITF比賽合作過雙打，今次第二次合作，Cody表示：「我們今日合作比預期好得多，彼此的默契手挺好的。」本站女雙衛冕的蔣欣玗說：「前幾天練習，其實效果不特別好，今天反而比得不錯。」27歲的莊欣玗來頭不少，除了是應屆名古屋亞運混雙銅牌得主，她今年在「大滿貫」的溫網（跟同胞徐一璠拍檔）取得四強席位。</p>\n<img alt=\"徐嘉華攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a43c4c9f0cf8d75b226c6e1af2104b50/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-03_at_7_31_21_PM_0.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"王康怡\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7ec34d349a9dddb3f3cdc8419815ca56/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-03_at_7_31_33_PM_0.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"蔣欣玗\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0a4d680c60e102f2641442bee90459e7/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-03_at_7_31_44_PM_0.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"蔣欣玗有粉絲帶備打氣紙牌。徐嘉華攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5315bfe1b9108a28d566e8004316fb8e/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-03_at_7_32_32_PM_0.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/feffa0b048c4ea19864ca46ff76d09b1/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-03_at_7_32_41_PM_0.jpeg\"/>\n<p>對於再跟「大滿貫」常客的蔣欣玗再次合作，24歲的Cody說從對方身上學到不少：「蔣欣玗在場上會帶帶我、教教我，對我是一個好好的機會去吸收她的經驗。」她們不約而同表示期望越走越遠，在決賽對大威、徐一璠組合。</p>\n<p>記者/攝影：徐嘉華</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T12:01:10.504562+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":484,"images":12,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T11:40:58+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T11:58:46.199636+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T11:58:46.199636+00:00","content_hash":"27bec1126f0ccd79a2162b5ec967ef4b74b53131d701f78f3c4727fe3c13c2d7","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}